OL,3,GNEWSASouthport and Nottingham attack
OL,4,Avictims demand end to data breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted NHS England, the
OL,7,FDepartment for Health and Social Care
OL,8,Fand Department for Culture for comment.
